From 7982fbbebc6a5b4cbff2c8dfff707d19b175f4b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sun Yuechi <sunyuechi@iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 22:15:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rgw/lancedb: bump lancedb to 0.39.0 (lance 12)

lance-core < 11 has no SIMD_SUPPORT branch for riscv64 and fails to
compile there. lance 12 moves to object_store 0.14, whose result structs
gained an `extensions` field.

The lancedb-c bump lives on the sunyuechi/lancedb-c fork until upstream
takes it.

Signed-off-by: Sun Yuechi <sunyuechi@iscas.ac.cn>
